<view class="guidance"><button class="guide-toggle row" bindtap="toggle" aria-expanded="{{expanded}}"><view class="toggle-title"><image class="inline-icon" src="{{icons.heart}}"/><text>{{expanded ? '从此刻的感受开始' : activeScale ? '继续心理自评' : '心情记录 · 心理自评'}}</text></view><view class="toggle-label"><text>{{expanded ? '收起' : '展开'}}</text><image class="toggle-chevron" src="{{expanded ? icons.chevronUp : icons.chevronDown}}" aria-hidden="{{true}}"/></view></button><view wx:if="{{expanded}}" class="guide-content">
  <native-questionnaire wx:if="{{activeScale}}" title="{{activeScale.title}}" description="回顾过去 2 周（14 天），按每种感受出现的频率选择最符合你的选项；不只看今天或最严重的一天。生活影响补充题不计入总分。" questions="{{activeScale.questions}}" scored-items="{{activeScale.scoredItems}}" support-index="{{activeScale.id === 'phq9' ? 8 : -1}}" support-text="{{supportText}}" bind:complete="finish" bind:close="cancelQuiz"/>
  <view wx:elif="{{result}}" class="guide-result"><view class="row"><text class="guide-heading">{{result.title}}</text><button class="close" bindtap="closeResult"><image class="inline-icon" src="{{icons.close}}"/></button></view><view class="guide-score"><text>{{result.score}}</text><text> / {{result.maxScore}} 分</text></view><text class="caption"><text class="bold">{{result.description.label}}</text>。{{result.description.text}}</text><text wx:if="{{result.needsSupport}}" class="support">{{supportText}}</text><text class="caption">这是对近两周感受的自我记录，不能用于诊断。若困扰持续或影响生活，可以寻求专业支持。</text><button class="answer-disclosure {{answerDetails ? 'open' : ''}}" bindtap="toggleAnswers" aria-expanded="{{answerDetails}}">查看回答与计分</button><view wx:if="{{answerDetails}}" class="answer-details"><view class="answer-list"><view wx:for="{{result.answerItems}}" wx:key="question" class="answer-item"><text>{{item.question}}</text><text class="bold">{{item.answer}} · {{item.scoreText}}</text></view></view><text class="answer-note">{{result.scoredItems}} 道计分题，每题 0–3 分，相加得到总分。{{result.hasImpact ? '生活影响补充题不计入总分。' : ''}}</text></view>
    <view class="supplement"><text class="guide-heading">补充描述（选填，不计分）</text><text class="caption">可以写下发生了什么、感受何时出现，或哪些情况让你舒服一些。可跳过，补充内容不会改变量表得分。</text><textarea value="{{supplement}}" maxlength="500" bindinput="changeSupplement" placeholder="例如：最近工作压力较大，晚上容易反复想白天的事…" placeholder-style="color:#776357;opacity:1;line-height:1.7" disabled="{{!canEdit}}"/><text class="private">{{supplement.length}} / 500 字{{supplementDirty ? ' · 尚未保存，请先保存或取消修改，再聊聊结果。' : ''}}</text><view wx:if="{{supplementDirty}}" class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="cancelSupplement">取消修改</button><button class="primary" bindtap="saveSupplement" disabled="{{!canEdit}}">保存补充</button></view><checkbox-group bindchange="toggleInclude"><label class="share-note"><view class="share-box {{includeSupplement ? 'checked' : ''}} {{!result.supplement || supplementDirty ? 'disabled' : ''}}"><checkbox value="share" checked="{{includeSupplement}}" disabled="{{!result.supplement || supplementDirty}}" color="#246D50"/><view class="share-mark"/></view><text>将已保存的补充描述一起发到对话</text></label></checkbox-group><text class="private">补充描述默认不发送。仅勾选上方选项并点击“聊聊结果”后发送，可随时编辑或清空。</text><text wx:if="{{noteFeedback}}" class="private">{{noteFeedback}}</text></view>
    <text class="private">{{storageNotice}}点击“聊聊结果”才会把分数、生活影响及 PHQ-9 第 9 题回答摘要发到对话。</text><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="repeat"><image class="inline-icon" src="{{icons.rotate}}"/>重新自评</button><button class="primary" bindtap="discuss" disabled="{{disabled || sending || supplementDirty}}">聊聊结果 <image class="inline-icon" src="{{icons.arrowWhite}}"/></button></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{showScales}}" class="guide-scales"><view class="row"><text class="guide-heading">用一份短问卷了解自己</text><button class="close" bindtap="closeScales"><image class="inline-icon" src="{{icons.close}}"/></button></view><text class="caption">面向 18 岁及以上成人，回顾近两周的感受。自评不能代替专业诊断。</text><view class="private source-links"><text>量表来源：</text><button class="text-button" data-source="original" bindtap="copySource">中文量表</button><text> · </text><button class="text-button" data-source="manual" bindtap="copySource">计分说明</button></view><text wx:if="{{sourceError}}" class="feedback">{{sourceError}}</text><view class="scale-list"><button wx:for="{{scales}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="start" disabled="{{!canEdit}}"><view><text class="bold">{{item.title}}</text><text class="private">{{item.duration}} · {{item.scoredItems}} 题 + 1 道补充题</text></view><image class="guide-arrow" src="{{icons.scaleArrow}}" aria-hidden="{{true}}"/></button></view><text class="private">{{saveChat ? accountUser ? '完成后同步到微信账户，可在“我的”关闭保存。' : '完成后保存在当前设备，可在“我的”关闭保存。' : '已关闭保存记录，问卷只在本次页面中保留。'}}结果由你决定是否发到对话。</text></view>
  <block wx:else><text class="caption">今天心情怎么样？选一个，我们慢慢聊。</text><view class="moods"><button wx:for="{{moods}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="sendMood" disabled="{{disabled || sending}}" class="{{selectedMood === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}"><image wx:if="{{item.symbolImage}}" class="mood-symbol-image" src="{{item.symbolImage}}" aria-hidden="{{true}}"/><text wx:else class="mood-symbol">{{item.symbol}}</text><text>{{item.label}}</text></button></view><button class="assess-link row" bindtap="showScales"><view><image class="inline-icon" src="{{icons.clipboard}}"/><text class="bold">做个心理自评</text><text class="private">约 2–3 分钟</text></view><image class="guide-arrow" src="{{icons.arrowRight}}" aria-hidden="{{true}}"/></button><view wx:if="{{results.length}}" class="recent"><text>最近自评</text><button wx:for="{{results}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectResult"><text>{{item.label}} · {{item.score}}/{{item.maxScore}} 分</text><image class="guide-arrow" src="{{icons.arrowRight}}" aria-hidden="{{true}}"/></button></view></block>
  <text wx:if="{{feedback}}" class="support">{{feedback}}</text><text wx:if="{{sending}}" class="private">正在发送到对话…</text>
</view></view>
